# EtPhoneInput Component

## Purpose & Scope

This is the dumb version of the phone input component. For the smart version which includes the dropdown logic use <PhoneInput> instead.
`EtPhoneInput` is a phone number input component for the eToro design system. It provides a two-part input layout with:

- **Prefix section (left)**: Country flag (via `EtCountryFlag`) + dial code + dropdown chevron. Fixed width (130px). Tappable to trigger country selection.
- **Number section (right)**: Text input field for the phone number digits. Fixed width (193px).
- **Built-in states**: default (empty), focused, filled, error, disabled
- **Error message**: Automatically rendered below the input row when `error` is provided
- **Uncontrolled by default**: Uses `defaultValue` instead of `value` for better performance (consistent with `Input` v2)
- **Optional controlled mode**: Pass `value` for caller-driven text and (optionally) `selection` + `onSelectionChange` for caller-driven cursor — required when an on-screen custom keyboard synthesises keystrokes (see "Cursor-aware editing" below)

**Does NOT handle:**

- Country selection logic (the parent handles it via `onPrefixPress` callback)
- Phone number validation (handle in parent, pass `error` prop for display)
- Phone number formatting/masking (handle in parent via `onChangeText`)
- Form submission logic (handle in parent)

## Visual Design

The component renders two rounded boxes side by side:

```text
┌─────────────┐  ┌──────────────────────┐
│ 🇬🇧 +44  ▾  │  │ Number               │
└─────────────┘  └──────────────────────┘
  Error Validation (optional)
```

Prefix box: auto-width (content-sized, ~130px). Number box: flex: 1 (fills remaining row space, 68px height).

### States (from Figma)

| State             | Prefix text color     | Number text color     | Border color           | Cursor | Error |
| ----------------- | --------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------- | ------ | ----- |
| Default (empty)   | `textTertiaryNeutral` | `textPrimaryNeutral`  | `dividerSecondary`     | No     | No    |
| Focused (typing)  | `textPrimaryNeutral`  | `textPrimaryNeutral`  | `textSecondaryNeutral` | Green  | No    |
| Inactive (filled) | `textPrimaryNeutral`  | `textPrimaryNeutral`  | `dividerSecondary`     | No     | No    |
| Error (filled)    | `textPrimaryNeutral`  | `textPrimaryNeutral`  | `dividerSecondary`     | No     | Yes   |
| Disabled          | `textTertiaryNeutral` | `textTertiaryNeutral` | `dividerSecondary`     | No     | No    |

